# A rectangle beside a construction line, turned about it by a lathe
# into a ring, and the ring hollowed open at its outer side, picked
# with the mouse: a channel round the ring. The same as
# path_shell_lathe.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/shell_lathe).
key r
move 350 200
down L 350 200
up L 350 200
move 420 300
down L 420 300
up L 420 300
key esc
key s
move 300 150
down L 300 150
up L 300 150
move 300 350
down L 300 350
up L 300 350
key esc
click-entity 80000
key g
click-entity 80000
key l shift
click-face face 12 of g003-lathe
menu Features|Shell Solid
